OL,3,AKim Kardashian's Skims offers refunds
OL,4,Afor $148 advent calendar after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FKim Kardashian's Skims is offering
OL,7,Fcustomers refunds for its $148 (#110)
OL,8,Fadvent calendar which has been widely
OL,9,Fcriticised on social media.
OL,11,FThe accessories advent calendar
OL,12,Fpromised "twelve days of fun surprises"
OL,13,Fbut has been mocked online for the
OL,14,Fquality of its contents, such as hair
OL,15,Fclips and keychains, with some
OL,16,Fcomparing them to something you would
OL,17,Ffind down the back of a sofa.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
