OL,3,AKim Kardashian's Skims offers refunds
OL,4,Afor $148 advent calendar after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Skims has told a
OL,7,Fnumber of media outlets "for some, the
OL,8,Fcalendar didn't meet expectations" and
OL,9,Fthe company has "personally contacted
OL,10,Fevery customer" to offer a full refund
OL,11,For credit to put towards other
OL,12,Fproducts".
OL,14,FThe BBC has contacted Skims for
OL,15,Fcomment.
